{"id":"jugement","lemma":"jugement","pos":"noun","rank":1842,"glosses":["judgment"],"ipa":"/ʒyʒ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/09/Fr-jugement.ogg/Fr-jugement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"jugements"},"formAudio":{"jugements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-jugements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il manque de jugement.","en":"He lacks judgement.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"lack, absence"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je laisse cela à votre jugement.","en":"I will leave it to your judgement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Je laisse la chose à ton jugement.","en":"I leave the matter to your judgement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"thing"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"C'est une erreur de jugement.","en":"It's an error in judgment.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"error"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Nous pouvons nous fier à son jugement.","en":"We can rely on his judgement.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"proud"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]}]}